      "stem": "In the following question, three statements numbered I, II and III are given. Read all the statements and determine the cause and effect relationship between them.\nI. In urban areas, the poor bear the brunt of environmental effects such as water or air pollution.\nII. The rapid urban development has outpaced the development of environmental infrastructure in many large cities. III. Just for the own sake of profit, builders in urban areas are indulge in construction work without tendering about the environment and urban poor, who mostly dies from chronical diseases.",
